{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setAdditionalAuthorizationOptions:"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"UNAuthorizationOptions","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@E@UNAuthorizationOptions"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"options"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"options","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The additional ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNAuthorizationOptions"},{"type":"text","text":" to request."}]}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When calling "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"registerForPushNotifications"},{"type":"text","text":", the SDK requests these permissions by default:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNAuthorizationOptionBadge"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNAuthorizationOptionSound"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNAuthorizationOptionAlert"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"UNAuthorizationOptionCarPlay","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this method to request additional capabilities on top of the defaults."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The options you set here are combined (bitwise OR) with the default options","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"before being passed to ","type":"text"},{"code":"UNUserNotificationCenter.requestAuthorizationWithOptions:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Must be called "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"before","type":"text"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"registerForPushNotifications"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Available Options","anchor":"Available-Options","level":2},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"UNAuthorizationOptionProvisional","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (iOS 12+) — Delivers notifications quietly to the Notification Center","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"without showing a permission dialog. The user sees notifications silently and can then choose to keep or disable them."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Use this for a “soft opt-in” strategy to avoid users declining the permission prompt upfront.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"UNAuthorizationOptionCriticalAlert","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (iOS 12+) — Allows notifications that bypass Do Not Disturb and the mute switch."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Requires a special entitlement from Apple (must be approved via Apple Developer portal)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Intended for medical, health, safety, and public security apps."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNAuthorizationOptionProvidesAppNotificationSettings"},{"text":" (iOS 12+) — Adds a “Configure in App” button","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the system notification settings for your app. When tapped, iOS calls"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"userNotificationCenter:openSettingsForNotification:"},{"type":"text","text":" on your "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNUserNotificationCenterDelegate"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"ty